{"sha": "b7d9d0b8432bb4fba22b6cbe857b7fcd0ff88ab32ac04743291fb80a1438acbb", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:particle-diffusion} 章 --- 粒子扩散}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:particle-diffusion:1}", "$L^2/D$：糖 $5 \\times 10^6\\,\\unit{s}$（两个月）；香水同样；", "组织 \\qty{500}{s}；细胞 \\qty{0.05}{s}。扩散确实完成", "了最后一项（勉强也完成倒数第二项）；对流完成其余部分。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:particle-diffusion:2}", "$j = D\\Delta n/e = \\qty{1e-5}{mol/m^2/s}$；$\\times \\qty{1e-4}{m^2}$：", "\\qty{1e-9}{mol/s}，即每秒 $6 \\times 10^{14}$ 个分子；", "$R_{\\text{d}} = e/DS = \\qty{1e9}{s/m^3}$；两个串联时减半。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:particle-diffusion:3}", "$\\sqrt{2Dt}$：\\qty{45}{\\micro m}、\\qty{2.7}{mm}、\\qty{13}{mm}；峰值 $N/\\sqrt{4\\pi", "Dt}$：\\qty{9e23}{m^{-3}}、\\qty{1.5e22}{m^{-3}}、\\qty{3e21}{m^{-3}}；峰值降至 $1\\%$", "所需时间延长 $10^4$ 倍：\\qty{1e4}{s}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:particle-diffusion:4}", "$D \\approx \\qty{1.2e-5}{m^2/s}$；$N = (L/\\ell)^2 = 2 \\times 10^{14}$；$N\\ell/v^*", "= \\qty{3e4}{s}$，与 \\qty{2}{ms} 相比。水的估算给出", "\\qty{2e-8}{m^2/s}，为实测值的十倍 --- 在液体中，一个", "分子在邻居构成的“笼”中晃动，其相继的步长", "呈负相关；有效步长更短。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:particle-diffusion:5}", "(a) $Dn'' = q$：$n = n_0 - q(a^2 - x^2)/2D$。(b) $n(0) \\ge 0$：$a \\le", "\\sqrt{2Dn_0/q}$。(c) \\qty{0.28}{mm}。(d) 任何细胞距毛细血管的距离都不会超过", "几百微米（实际中为 $50$--\\qty{100}{\\micro m}", "，活跃组织中）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:particle-diffusion:6}", "(a) $n = n_{\\text{s}}a/r$，$\\Phi = 4\\pi D a n_{\\text{s}} = \\qty{3.6e-8}{mol/s}$。", "(b) $1.95 \\times 10^{-5}\\,\\unit{mol}$；\\qty{540}{s}。(c) $1/r$ 壳层的形成", "需时 $\\sim a^2/D \\approx \\qty{2000}{s}$，且颗粒缩小；搅拌", "将厚度为 $\\sim a$ 的壳层换成边界层 $\\delta \\ll a$", "并使通量乘以 $a/\\delta$。(d) $(rn')' = 0$：$n = A + B\\ln r$，", "在无穷远处不可能为零，因此不存在定态 ---", "圆柱形的“云”持续（按对数）增长。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:particle-diffusion:7}", "(a) $\\dd/\\dd t\\int n = D[n']_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} = 0$；$\\dd/\\dd t\\int x^2 n = D\\int", "x^2 n'' = 2D\\int n = 2DN$。(b) $\\partial_t[n(x,-t)] = -D\\,\\partial_x^2 n$：", "符号翻转。(c) 当 $t < 0$ 时，“宽度” $2Dt$ 为负：没有这样的", "状态 --- 脉冲无法反向复原。(d) $\\dd/\\dd t\\int n^2 = 2D\\int nn''", "= -2D\\int n'^2 \\le 0$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:particle-diffusion:8}", "(a) 见\\cref{prop:b2:particle-diffusion:erfc}。(b) $x = 2 \\times 1.16\\sqrt{Dt}", "= \\qty{0.62}{mm}$。(c) $4\\times$：\\qty{16}{h}。(d) $4/2.5 = \\qty{1.6}{h}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:particle-diffusion:9}", "(a) $D = \\qty{2.2e-13}{m^2/s}$；$\\sqrt{2Dt}$：\\qty{0.66}{\\micro m}、", "\\qty{5}{\\micro m}。(b) \\qty{7e-11}{m^2/s}。(c) $a = k_BT/6\\pi\\eta D =", "\\qty{0.44}{nm}$。(d) $\\langle x^2\\rangle = 2Dt = RTt/3\\pi\\eta a N_A$：", "除 $N_A$ 外，每个量都是测得的。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:particle-diffusion:10}", "(a) $Dn_1S/e$。(b) 粒子穿越需要 $\\sim e^2/D$ 的时间。(c)", "$e^2/6D = \\qty{670}{s}$，约合 11 分钟。(d) 时滞仅给出 $D$；", "而定态通量给出 $D \\times$（溶解度）：两次测量，", "两个未知量。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:particle-diffusion:11}", "(a) $n = n_\\infty(1 - a/r)$，$\\Phi = 4\\pi D a n_\\infty$。(b) $3.8 \\times", "10^6$ 每秒。(c) 受体相当于并联的电导，", "再与球壳串联：$\\Phi \\approx 4\\pi Dan_\\infty", "\\cdot N_{\\text{r}}s/(N_{\\text{r}}s + \\pi a)$；取最大值一半的条件为", "$N_{\\text{r}}s = \\pi a$：取 $s = \\qty{1}{nm}$，$N_{\\text{r}} \\approx", "3000$，覆盖表面的比例为 $N_{\\text{r}}s^2/4a^2 \\approx 10^{-3}$。", "(d) 每种受体只需极小的面积即可接近最大", "捕获量：细胞可以同时感知数千种物质。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:particle-diffusion:12}", "(a) 对 $t$ 取前向差分，对 $x$ 取中心二阶差分。(b)", "$\\alpha = 1/2$：$n_i^{k+1} = (n_{i-1}^k + n_{i+1}^k)/2$ --- 每个粒子以", "$1/2$ 的概率向左或向右跳动。(c) 对于 $n_i = (-1)^i$，$n^{k+1} =", "(1 - 4\\alpha)n^k$：$|1 - 4\\alpha| > 1$，当 $\\alpha > 1/2$ 时。(d) $\\Delta t \\le", "\\Delta x^2/2D = \\qty{3.3}{s}$；约 $1100$ 步。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:particle-diffusion:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $k_BT = \\qty{0.118}{eV}$，$E_{\\text{a}}/k_BT = 29.2$：$D =", "\\qty{1.6e-17}{m^2/s}$；在 \\qty{1000}{\\celsius} 时：\\qty{1.6e-18}{m^2/s} --- 相差", "$10$ 倍。", "", "\\textbf{2.} 反射面的处理借助脉冲的", "镜像，使 $x > 0$ 上的振幅加倍；$\\int_0^\\infty = (Q/\\sqrt{\\pi Dt})", "\\cdot \\tfrac12\\sqrt{4\\pi Dt} = Q$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} $Dt = \\qty{5.8e-14}{m^2}$；$\\sqrt{\\pi Dt} = \\qty{0.43}{\\micro m}$；$n_{\\text{s}}", "= \\qty{2.3e24}{m^{-3}}$。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $\\eu^{-x^2/4Dt} = 4.3 \\times 10^{-4}$：$x_j^2 = 4Dt \\times 7.75$，$x_j =", "\\qty{1.3}{\\micro m}$。", "", "\\textbf{5.} $n_{\\text{s}}$ 减半，对数降至 $7.05$，$4Dt$", "增为四倍：$x_j = \\qty{2.6}{\\micro m}$ --- 增幅不足一倍。", "", "\\textbf{6.} $\\delta D/D = (E_{\\text{a}}/k_BT)\\,\\delta T/T = 21\\%$；$x_j \\propto", "\\sqrt{Dt}$ 近似成立，故 $1\\%$ 的 $x_j$ 变化需 $2\\%$ 的 $D$ 变化：\\qty{1}{K}。", ""]}